rule LineOeeEscalation
	lineageTag: b981b674-8010-5d14-ade0-58a406443319
	statement: Per the OEE Targets and Escalation policy, if a production line's OEE stays below 60% for more than 15 minutes, notify the Plant Manager and open an incident review; if it stays below 60% for more than one hour, escalate to the Corp Exec daily flash report.

	ruleReferencedEntity equipment#ProductionLine

	ruleReferencedEntity production#OeeTarget
		propertyScope: specific
		ruleReferencedProperty target_oee

	ruleReferencedRelationship production#TargetForLine
